stance and uncovers a secret project known as Operation Kraken. This third-person tactical shooter spreads its missions across large maps modeled on real locations, and you can approach objectives with long-range shots, stealth or direct fighting.\n\nThe series' trademark kill camera follows bullets in slow motion as they hit their targets. Beyond the single-player campaign, you can team up online or face other players in PvP modes. Sniper Elite 5 suits people who enjoy patient, methodical shooters with a World War II backdrop."}}